{"id":"5d2a105faa1b4258","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-lee-homology-data.md","title":"Lee 变形及其诱导滤过","display":"df-lee-homology-data — Lee 变形及其诱导滤过","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-lee-homology-data","aliases":["58-df-lee-homology-data"],"display":"df-lee-homology-data — Lee 变形及其诱导滤过","depends_on":["[[../batch03/58-df-knot-resolution-data.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-knot-frobenius-complex.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-bijective.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-lee-homology-data"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-lee-homology-data</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-lee-homology-data — Lee 变形及其诱导滤过"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"eb086d7ad41bcaef\" href=\"?note=eb086d7ad41bcaef\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-knot-resolution-data.md\">../batch03/58-df-knot-resolution-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5faf0467ca9c794e\" href=\"?note=5faf0467ca9c794e\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-knot-frobenius-complex.md\">../batch03/58-df-knot-frobenius-complex.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d583890235faf0d5\" href=\"?note=d583890235faf0d5\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-bijective.md\">../batch18/58-df-bijective.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K,D,H,d,z,v,\\alpha,\\phi\\in V\">\\(K,D,H,d,z,v,\\alpha,\\phi\\in V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\\in\\mathbb Z\">\\(j\\in\\mathbb Z\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{DiagramOf}_S(D,K)\">\\(\\operatorname{DiagramOf}_S(D,K)\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"eb086d7ad41bcaef\" href=\"?note=eb086d7ad41bcaef\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-knot-resolution-data.md\">../batch03/58-df-knot-resolution-data.md</a>。</li>\n<li>使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb Q\">\\(\\mathbb Q\\)</span> 的通常域运算。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E_D,q_D,\\partial^1_{D,\\mathbb Q}\">\\(\\mathcal E_D,q_D,\\partial^1_{D,\\mathbb Q}\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5faf0467ca9c794e\" href=\"?note=5faf0467ca9c794e\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-knot-frobenius-complex.md\">../batch03/58-df-knot-frobenius-complex.md</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb Q^{\\mathcal E_D}\">\\(\\mathbb Q^{\\mathcal E_D}\\)</span> 上的加法、数乘逐点给出，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0_{\\mathcal E_D}\">\\(0_{\\mathcal E_D}\\)</span> 为零函数。商类均采用下面给出的实际陪集。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}},d_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}},Z_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}},B_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}},H_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}},F_D^j,\\delta_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}}\">\\(\\mathcal C_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}},d_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}},Z_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}},B_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}},H_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}},F_D^j,\\delta_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}}\\)</span> 及原三元接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LeeHomologyData}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(H,d,K)\">\\(\\mathrm{LeeHomologyData}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(H,d,K)\\)</span> 由下式定义。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bijective}\">\\(\\mathrm{Bijective}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> 使用所列依赖。允许以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi\">\\(\\phi\\)</span> 将计算出的商空间重标记到原实参 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span>；非零元域由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span> 的函数域显式记录。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal C_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}}&amp;:=\\mathbb Q^{\\mathcal E_D},\\qquad d_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}}:=\\partial^1_{D,\\mathbb Q},\\\\\nZ_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}}&amp;:=\\{z\\in\\mathcal C_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}}:d_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}}z=0_{\\mathcal E_D}\\},\\qquad\nB_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}}:=\\{d_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}}v:v\\in\\mathcal C_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}}\\},\\\\\nH_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}}&amp;:=\\{\\{z+b:b\\in B_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}}\\}:z\\in Z_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}}\\},\\qquad\n0_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}}:=B_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}},\\\\\nF_D^j&amp;:=\\{v\\in\\mathcal C_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}}:\\forall u\\in\\mathcal E_D\\;(q_D(u)&lt;j\\to v(u)=0)\\},\\\\\n\\delta_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}}(\\alpha)&amp;:=\\max\\{j\\in\\mathbb Z:\\alpha\\cap F_D^j\\ne\\varnothing\\}\n\\quad(\\alpha\\in H_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}}\\setminus\\{0_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}}\\}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal C_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}}&amp;:=\\mathbb Q^{\\mathcal E_D},\\qquad d_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}}:=\\partial^1_{D,\\mathbb Q},\\\\\nZ_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}}&amp;:=\\{z\\in\\mathcal C_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}}:d_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}}z=0_{\\mathcal E_D}\\},\\qquad\nB_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}}:=\\{d_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}}v:v\\in\\mathcal C_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}}\\},\\\\\nH_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}}&amp;:=\\{\\{z+b:b\\in B_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}}\\}:z\\in Z_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}}\\},\\qquad\n0_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}}:=B_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}},\\\\\nF_D^j&amp;:=\\{v\\in\\mathcal C_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}}:\\forall u\\in\\mathcal E_D\\;(q_D(u)&lt;j\\to v(u)=0)\\},\\\\\n\\delta_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}}(\\alpha)&amp;:=\\max\\{j\\in\\mathbb Z:\\alpha\\cap F_D^j\\ne\\varnothing\\}\n\\quad(\\alpha\\in H_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}}\\setminus\\{0_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}}\\}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{LeeHomologyData}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(H,d,K)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists D,\\phi\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{DiagramOf}_S(D,K)\\land\\mathrm{Bijective}(\\phi,H_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}},H)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}(d,H\\setminus\\{\\phi(0_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}})\\},\\mathbb Z)\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in H_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}}\\setminus\\{0_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}}\\}\\;\n\\bigl(d(\\phi(\\alpha))=\\delta_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}}(\\alpha)\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{LeeHomologyData}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(H,d,K)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists D,\\phi\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{DiagramOf}_S(D,K)\\land\\mathrm{Bijective}(\\phi,H_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}},H)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}(d,H\\setminus\\{\\phi(0_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}})\\},\\mathbb Z)\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in H_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}}\\setminus\\{0_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}}\\}\\;\n\\bigl(d(\\phi(\\alpha))=\\delta_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}}(\\alpha)\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Lee 微分采用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X^2=1\">\\(X^2=1\\)</span> 的两项修正；不是任选一个秩二向量空间及一个整数函数。</li>\n<li>滤过次数取同一非零同调类的所有循环代表中可达到的最高滤过层，而不是任选代表的量子次数。有限标记基确保最大值存在。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> 可以是等价的重标记载体，但滤过必须经同一个双射传递。原有三个实参没有增加。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<p>J. Rasmussen, <em>Khovanov homology and the slice genus</em>, §2.3 and Definitions 3.1, 3.4 (arXiv:math/0402131).</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch03/58-df-knot-resolution-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"eb086d7ad41bcaef","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-knot-resolution-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-knot-frobenius-complex.md","status":"resolved","id":"5faf0467ca9c794e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-knot-frobenius-complex.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-bijective.md","status":"resolved","id":"d583890235faf0d5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-bijective.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-knot-resolution-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"eb086d7ad41bcaef","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$K,D,H,d,z,v,\\alpha,\\phi\\in V$，$j\\in\\mathbb Z$。$\\operatorname{DiagramOf}_S(D,K)$ 使用 [[../batch03/58-df-knot-resolution-data.md]]。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-knot-frobenius-complex.md","status":"resolved","id":"5faf0467ca9c794e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"使用 $\\mathbb Q$ 的通常域运算。$\\mathcal E_D,q_D,\\partial^1_{D,\\mathbb Q}$ 使用 [[../batch03/58-df-knot-frobenius-complex.md]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"K,D,H,d,z,v,\\alpha,\\phi\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"j\\in\\mathbb Z","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{DiagramOf}_S(D,K)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E_D,q_D,\\partial^1_{D,\\mathbb Q}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb Q^{\\mathcal E_D}","display":false},{"tex":"0_{\\mathcal E_D}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}},d_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}},Z_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}},B_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}},H_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}},F_D^j,\\delta_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LeeHomologyData}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(H,d,K)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Bijective}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\phi","display":false},{"tex":"H","display":false},{"tex":"d","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal C_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}}&:=\\mathbb Q^{\\mathcal E_D},\\qquad d_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}}:=\\partial^1_{D,\\mathbb Q},\\\\\nZ_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}}&:=\\{z\\in\\mathcal C_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}}:d_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}}z=0_{\\mathcal E_D}\\},\\qquad\nB_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}}:=\\{d_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}}v:v\\in\\mathcal C_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}}\\},\\\\\nH_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}}&:=\\{\\{z+b:b\\in B_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}}\\}:z\\in Z_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}}\\},\\qquad\n0_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}}:=B_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}},\\\\\nF_D^j&:=\\{v\\in\\mathcal C_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}}:\\forall u\\in\\mathcal E_D\\;(q_D(u)<j\\to v(u)=0)\\},\\\\\n\\delta_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}}(\\alpha)&:=\\max\\{j\\in\\mathbb Z:\\alpha\\cap F_D^j\\ne\\varnothing\\}\n\\quad(\\alpha\\in H_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}}\\setminus\\{0_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}}\\}).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{LeeHomologyData}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(H,d,K)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\exists D,\\phi\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{DiagramOf}_S(D,K)\\land\\mathrm{Bijective}(\\phi,H_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}},H)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{Function}(d,H\\setminus\\{\\phi(0_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}})\\},\\mathbb Z)\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in H_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}}\\setminus\\{0_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}}\\}\\;\n\\bigl(d(\\phi(\\alpha))=\\delta_D^{\\mathrm{Lee}}(\\alpha)\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"X^2=1","display":false},{"tex":"H","display":false}],"bytes":2988,"backlinks":[{"id":"6ae44e6a67df968f","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LeeHomologyData}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(H,d,K)$ 使用 [[58-df-lee-homology-data.md]] 中的实际 Lee 复形与商滤过；$\\operatorname{dom}(d)$ 恰是 $H$ 的非零同调类载体。"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-768","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-lee-homology-data.md|58-df-lee-homology-data]]（batch12）"}],"outgoing":["e